	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Type the keyword (default &lt;kbd&gt;fuse&lt;/kbd&gt;) then a timer expression:

- `5m`, `1h`, `1h30m`, `45s` — durations
- `25` — a bare number means minutes
- `10:00`, `23:30` — the next occurrence of that wall-clock time

Add an optional name after the expression: `5m tea`, `10:00 standup`.
An empty query lists quick suggestions and a stop action; type `stop` (or `cancel`) to cancel the running timer.

Requires the Fuse menubar app; telling it auto-launches it.</string>
